"""Voice banks, part 1: food, health, beauty, fitness.

Each kind speaks in its own verbs: a restaurant serves and cooks, a clinic examines and treats, a salon styles, a gym trains.
Lines are short and warm, make no claim about a particular business (no awards, no counts, no "freshly made daily") and are
safe to print under any business of that kind. Placeholders: {i} item, {I} item with a capital, {list2}, {main}, {hours},
{city}, {book_how}. FAQ answers: (question, default answers, condition, answers when the prompt supplied that fact).
"""

